<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0">
<title>The Silent Inference Principle | AI FinOps & Cost-Efficiency Rulebook</title>
<meta name="description" content="The AI Cost-Efficiency Rulebook — applying the Silent Inference Principle to AI FinOps. 473x cost gap. Dashboard-verified. 8 models.">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800;900&family=Poppins:wght@600;700;800;900&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js@4.4.0/dist/chart.umd.min.js"></script>
<style>
:root{
--bg:#0b1120;--bg2:#0f172a;--bg3:#162033;--bg4:#1f2a3d;
--b:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);--ba:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
--t:#f1f5f9;--t2:#94a3b8;--t3:#64748b;
--ac:#3b82f6;--gn:#10b981;--am:#f59e0b;--rd:#ef4444;
--pu:#8b5cf6;--cy:#06b6d4;
}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-snap-type:y mandatory;overflow-y:scroll}
body{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--t);line-height:1.6}
.slide{min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;scroll-snap-align:start;position:relative;padding:3rem 2rem;overflow:hidden}
.slide::before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:0}
.s0{background:var(--bg)}
.s0::before{background:radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 50% at 50% 30%,rgba(59,130,246,0.08),transparent),radial-gradient(ellipse 40% 30% at 80% 70%,rgba(239,68,68,0.05),transparent)}
.s1,.s3,.s5,.s7,.s9{background:var(--bg2)}
.s2,.s4,.s6,.s8{background:var(--bg)}
.inr{position:relative;z-index:1;max-width:960px;width:100%;margin:0 auto}.inr.wide{max-width:1100px}
.pulse{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:0.5rem;padding:0.3rem 1rem;background:rgba(59,130,246,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.2);border-radius:100px;font-size:0.68rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.5px;color:var(--ac);margin-bottom:1.5rem;text-transform:uppercase}
.pulse .dot{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--gn);animation:pulse 2s infinite}
@keyframes pulse{0%,100%{opacity:1}50%{opacity:.3}}
h1{font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(2rem,5.5vw,4rem);font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-1px;line-height:1.08;margin-bottom:1rem;color:#fff}
h2{font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3.5vw,2.4rem);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.5px;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:0.8rem;color:#fff}
h3{font-weight:700;margin-bottom:0.4rem;font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--t)}
.pain{font-size:clamp(0.95rem,2vw,1.2rem);font-weight:600;color:var(--rd);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.4}
.lead{font-size:0.92rem;color:var(--t2);max-width:680px;margin:0 auto 1.8rem;line-height:1.65}
.big{font-size:clamp(2.5rem,7vw,6rem);font-weight:900;font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;line-height:1;margin:0.4rem 0}
.big.gn{color:var(--gn)}.big.rd{color:var(--rd)}.big.am{color:var(--am)}.big.ac{color:var(--ac)}.big.cy{color:var(--cy)}
.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:0.8rem;margin:1.5rem 0}
.stat{background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--b);border-radius:14px;padding:1.2rem;text-align:center;transition:transform .25s,border-color .25s}
.stat:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);border-color:var(--ba)}
.stat .v{font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:900;font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif}
.stat .v.gn{color:var(--gn)}.stat .v.rd{color:var(--rd)}.stat .v.am{color:var(--am)}.stat .v.ac{color:var(--ac)}
.stat .l{font-size:0.65rem;color:var(--t3);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.8px;margin-top:0.3rem;font-weight:600}
.stat .s{font-size:0.7rem;color:var(--t2);margin-top:0.15rem;line-height:1.3}
.exec{background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(59,130,246,0.06),rgba(16,185,129,0.04));border:1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.15);border-radius:16px;padding:1.8rem;margin:2rem 0;text-align:left}
.exec h3{color:var(--ac);font-size:0.75rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:1rem}
.exec li{margin:0.5rem 0;font-size:0.85rem;line-height:1.6;color:var(--t2);list-style:none;padding-left:1.5rem;position:relative}
.exec li::before{content:'';position:absolute;left:0;top:0.55rem;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%}
.exec li:nth-child(1)::before{background:var(--ac)}.exec li:nth-child(2)::before{background:var(--gn)}.exec li:nth-child(3)::before{background:var(--am)}
.exec strong{color:var(--t)}
.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr));gap:0.8rem;margin:1rem 0}
.card{background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--b);border-radius:14px;padding:1.2rem;text-align:center;transition:all .3s;cursor:pointer;position:relative}
.card:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);border-color:var(--ba);box-shadow:0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.3)}
.card.expanded{grid-column:1/-1;text-align:left;padding:1.5rem}
.card .detail{display:none;margin-top:1rem;padding-top:1rem;border-top:1px solid var(--b);font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--t2);line-height:1.7;text-align:left}
.card.expanded .detail{display:block}
.card .cname{font-size:0.72rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin-bottom:0.5rem;color:var(--t)}
.card .cval{font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:900;font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif}
.card .cval.gn{color:var(--gn)}.card .cval.rd{color:var(--rd)}.card .cval.am{color:var(--am)}.card .cval.ac{color:var(--ac)}
.card .csub{font-size:0.7rem;color:var(--t2);margin:0.3rem 0}
.card .ctag{display:inline-block;padding:0.15rem 0.5rem;border-radius:4px;font-size:0.58rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin:0.3rem 0}
.card .ctag.gn{background:rgba(16,185,129,0.1);color:var(--gn);border:1px solid rgba(16,185,129,0.2)}
.card .ctag.rd{background:rgba(239,68,68,0.1);color:var(--rd);border:1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.2)}
.card .ctag.am{background:rgba(245,158,11,0.1);color:var(--am);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.2)}
.bar{height:4px;border-radius:2px;margin:0.5rem 0;background:var(--b);overflow:hidden}
.bar .fill{height:100%;border-radius:2px;transition:width .5s}
.bar .fill.gn{background:var(--gn)}.bar .fill.ac{background:var(--ac)}.bar .fill.am{background:var(--am)}.bar .fill.rd{background:var(--rd)}
.wtm{background:var(--bg3);border-left:3px solid var(--ac);border-radius:0 10px 10px 0;padding:1rem 1.2rem;margin:1rem 0;font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--t2);line-height:1.7}
.wtm strong{color:var(--t)}
.wtm .role{display:inline-block;padding:0.12rem 0.4rem;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.6rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin-right:0.3rem;margin-bottom:0.2rem}
.wtm .role.cto{background:rgba(59,130,246,0.15);color:var(--ac)}.wtm .role.cfo{background:rgba(16,185,129,0.15);color:var(--gn)}.wtm .role.coo{background:rgba(245,158,11,0.15);color:var(--am)}
.constraints{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0.3rem;margin:1rem 0;max-width:650px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}
.cr{display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr 1.2fr 1.2fr 0.6fr 0.6fr;gap:0.5rem;align-items:center;padding:0.45rem 0.8rem;background:var(--bg3);border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--b);font-size:0.73rem}
.cr.head{background:var(--bg4);font-weight:600;font-size:0.63rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;color:var(--t2)}
.cr .nm{font-weight:500}.cr .fl{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:0.63rem;color:var(--t3)}.cr .ck{text-align:center}
.strat-stack{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0.45rem;max-width:660px;margin:1rem auto}
.sr{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:1rem;padding:0.7rem 1rem;background:var(--bg3);border:1px solid var(--b);border-radius:10px;font-size:0.78rem;text-align:left;}
.sr .num{font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:900;font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;min-width:1.8rem;text-align:center;flex-shrink:0}
.sr .num.gn{color:var(--gn)}.sr .num.ac{color:var(--ac)}.sr .num.am{color:var(--am)}.sr .num.rd{color:var(--rd)}.sr .num.pu{color:var(--pu)}
.sr .txt{flex:1}.sr .txt strong{color:var(--t)}.sr .lev{display:block;font-size:0.65rem;color:var(--t3);margin-top:0.2rem}
.tbl{overflow-x:auto;margin:1rem 0;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--b);max-width:700px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}
.tbl table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:0.74rem}
.tbl th{text-align:left;padding:0.5rem 0.7rem;color:var(--t2);font-weight:600;font-size:0.6rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ba);background:var(--bg4)}
.tbl td{padding:0.4rem 0.7rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--b);font-size:0.73rem}
.mono{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:0.7rem}
.gn{color:var(--gn)}.rd{color:var(--rd)}.am{color:var(--am)}.ac{color:var(--ac)}.cy{color:var(--cy)}.pu{color:var(--pu)}
.doors{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1rem;margin:1rem 0}
.door{background:var(--bg3);border:1px solid var(--b);border-radius:14px;padding:1.3rem;text-align:left}
.door.tw{border-left:3px solid var(--gn)}.door.ow{border-left:3px solid var(--rd)}
.door h3{font-size:0.85rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem}.door.tw h3{color:var(--gn)}.door.ow h3{color:var(--rd)}
.door p,.door li{font-size:0.78rem;color:var(--t2);line-height:1.6;margin:0.3rem 0}.door ul{list-style:none;padding:0}.door li::before{content:'→ ';color:var(--t3)}
.cta-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:0.5rem;padding:0.7rem 1.8rem;background:var(--ac);color:#fff;border-radius:100px;font-weight:600;font-size:0.85rem;text-decoration:none;transition:all .3s;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif}
.cta-btn:hover{background:#2563eb;transform:translateY(-1px);box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(59,130,246,0.3)}
.cta-btn.ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--t2);border:1px solid var(--ba)}
.cta-btn.ghost:hover{color:#fff;border-color:var(--t3);box-shadow:none}
.cta-bar{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:1rem;margin:1.5rem 0;flex-wrap:wrap}
.roi-calc{background:var(--bg3);border:1px solid var(--b);border-radius:14px;padding:1.5rem;margin:1rem 0;text-align:left}
.roi-calc .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:1rem}
.roi-calc label{display:block;font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;color:var(--t3);margin-bottom:0.3rem}
.roi-calc input[type=range]{width:100%;accent-color:var(--ac)}
.roi-calc .val{font-size:0.7rem;color:var(--ac);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace}
.roi-out{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(120px,1fr));gap:0.6rem;margin-top:1rem}
.roi-out .o{background:var(--bg4);border-radius:8px;padding:0.8rem;text-align:center}
.roi-out .o .ov{font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:900;font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif}
.roi-out .o .ov.gn{color:var(--gn)}.roi-out .o .ov.rd{color:var(--rd)}.roi-out .o .ol{font-size:0.6rem;color:var(--t3);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin-top:0.2rem}
.chart-wrap{max-width:700px;margin:1rem auto}.chart-wrap canvas{width:100%!important}
.note{font-size:0.72rem;color:var(--t3);padding:0.6rem 1rem;background:var(--bg3);border:1px solid var(--b);border-radius:8px;margin:0.8rem 0;text-align:center}
.risk-box{background:rgba(245,158,11,0.05);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.15);border-radius:14px;padding:1.3rem;font-size:0.82rem;color:var(--t2);line-height:1.7;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:1rem}
.risk-box .icon{font-size:1.8rem;flex-shrink:0}.risk-box strong{color:var(--am)}
.refs{font-size:0.7rem;color:var(--t3);line-height:1.7;margin:1rem 0}.refs strong{color:var(--t2)}
footer{text-align:center;padding:2rem 0;color:var(--t3);font-size:0.72rem;line-height:1.6}
footer a{color:var(--ac);text-decoration:none}
.nav-dots{position:fixed;right:1.2rem;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);z-index:200;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.5rem}
.nav-dots a{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--t3);transition:all .3s;display:block}
.nav-dots a.active,.nav-dots a:hover{background:var(--ac);transform:scale(1.4)}
@media(max-width:768px){
.nav-dots{display:none}.slide{padding:2rem 1rem}.doors{grid-template-columns:1fr}.roi-calc .row{grid-template-columns:1fr}.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav class="nav-dots" aria-label="Slide navigation">
<a href="#s0" class="active"></a><a href="#s1"></a><a href="#s2"></a><a href="#s3"></a><a href="#s4"></a><a href="#s5"></a><a href="#s6"></a><a href="#s7"></a><a href="#s8"></a><a href="#s9"></a>
</nav>

<!-- S0: HERO -->
<section class="slide s0" id="s0"><div class="inr">
<div class="pulse"><span class="dot"></span> AI FinOps Rulebook · Alpha · Dashboard-Verified · 8 Models</div>
<p class="pain">You're spending millions on AI inference. Your CFO wants answers. Your engineers want tools. Nobody can tell you which model actually saves money — or whether today's "cheap" model will bankrupt you in 2030 when energy prices spike.</p>
<h1>The AI Cost-Efficiency Rulebook</h1>
<p class="lead" style="font-size:1rem;color:var(--t)">The <strong style="color:var(--ac)">Silent Inference Principle</strong>: Some models implement constraints silently — others pay a <strong style="color:var(--rd)">24–120% Explanation Tax</strong> for narrating every step. Both produce correct code. The cost difference is <strong style="color:var(--gn)">473×</strong>.</p>
<div class="stats"><div class="stat"><div class="v rd">473×</div><div class="l">Cost Gap Per Dollar</div><div class="s">DeepSeek: 1,873 builds/$ vs Claude: 4</div></div><div class="stat"><div class="v gn">1,873</div><div class="l">Builds per Dollar</div><div class="s">DeepSeek v4 Pro leads</div></div><div class="stat"><div class="v ac">24–120%</div><div class="l">Explanation Tax</div><div class="s">The cost of narrating reasoning</div></div><div class="stat"><div class="v am">1.8×</div><div class="l">2050 Energy Risk</div><div class="s">IEA-projected EPM</div></div></div>

<div class="exec" style="text-align:left"><h3>Executive Summary — What Decision-Makers Need to Know</h3>
<ol style="padding-left:0;list-style:none">
<li><strong>Core finding:</strong> DeepSeek is 473× more cost-efficient per dollar than Claude — while implementing all the same constraints in working code.</li>
<li><strong>Why:</strong> DeepSeek uses Silent Inference (GRPO compresses reasoning into latent space); Claude pays a 24–120% Explanation Tax for narrating every recovery step.</li>
<li><strong>What to do:</strong> Route routine tasks to DeepSeek. Use Claude only for mission-critical work requiring perfect pass rates. Use the ROI calculator below to model your savings.</li>
<ol>
</div>
<a href="#s1" class="cta-btn">The Rulebook Lexicon ↓</a>
</div></section>

<!-- S1: LEXICON -->
<section class="slide s1" id="s1"><div class="inr wide">
<div class="pulse">01 · The Rulebook Lexicon</div>
<h2>The principles that govern<br>AI inference economics.</h2>
<p class="lead">Every term maps to a measurable equation. Every equation maps to a business decision. This is the unified framework.</p>
<div class="cards" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(170px,1fr))">
<div class="card" style="text-align:left"><div class="cname" style="text-align:left;color:var(--gn)">Silent Inference</div><p style="font-size:0.72rem;color:var(--t2);line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:0.5rem">Implementation = True<br>Narration = False</p><p style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:0.62rem;color:var(--t3)">Measured: code/reasoning token ratio ≥ 90%</p><p style="font-size:0.65rem;color:var(--t3);margin-top:0.5rem">↳ Industry: Cost-Aware Architecture</p></div>
<div class="card" style="text-align:left"><div class="cname" style="text-align:left;color:var(--rd)">Explanation Tax</div><p style="font-size:0.72rem;color:var(--t2);line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:0.5rem">ϵ = N_expl / N_code</p><p style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:0.62rem;color:var(--t3)">Cost penalty for narration.<br>Measured: 24–120%</p><p style="font-size:0.65rem;color:var(--t3);margin-top:0.5rem">↳ Industry: Reasoning Token Overhead</p></div>
<div class="card" style="text-align:left"><div class="cname" style="text-align:left;color:var(--am)">N² Tax</div><p style="font-size:0.72rem;color:var(--t2);line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:0.5rem">βv · N(N−1)/2</p><p style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:0.62rem;color:var(--t3)">Quadratic compounding of context inflation in cumulative cost</p><p style="font-size:0.65rem;color:var(--t3);margin-top:0.5rem">↳ Industry: Inference Production Frontier (Zhuang 2025)</p></div>
<div class="card" style="text-align:left"><div class="cname" style="text-align:left;color:var(--ac)">EPM Horizon</div><p style="font-size:0.72rem;color:var(--t2);line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:0.5rem">EPM(t) = 1.00 + 0.016(t−2024)</p><p style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:0.62rem;color:var(--t3)">The point where energy costs flip the cost equation. 1.8× by 2050.</p><p style="font-size:0.65rem;color:var(--t3);margin-top:0.5rem">↳ Industry: 4Ms Framework (Google Cloud)</p></div>
<div class="card" style="text-align:left"><div class="cname" style="text-align:left;color:var(--cy)">Cost-Per-Pass</div><p style="font-size:0.72rem;color:var(--t2);line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:0.5rem">CostPerOutcome = C(K/P, v) / K</p><p style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:0.62rem;color:var(--t3)">True cost per accepted outcome. Accounts for failed retries via P_m.</p><p style="font-size:0.65rem;color:var(--t3);margin-top:0.5rem">↳ Industry: Cost-of-Pass (Zhou et al., arXiv:2508.02694)</p></div>
</div>
<a href="#s2" class="cta-btn ghost">The Silent Inference Principle →</a>
</div></section>

<!-- S2: PRINCIPLE -->
<section class="slide s1" id="s1"><div class="inr">
<div class="pulse">01 · The Silent Inference Principle</div>
<h2>Knowing what to do without saying it.</h2>
<p class="lead">A model exhibits <strong style="color:var(--gn)">Silent Inference</strong> when it correctly implements all required constraints in code without generating explicit narration. <strong>Implementation = True, Narration = False.</strong> The cost delta when a model does narrate is the <strong style="color:var(--rd)">Explanation Tax</strong>.</p>
<div class="stats"><div class="stat"><div class="v gn">386</div><div class="l">DeepSeek Chars</div><div class="s">GRPO latent reasoning · $0.0001/char</div></div><div class="stat"><div class="v rd">1,639</div><div class="l">Claude Chars</div><div class="s">Explicit chain-of-thought · $0.0007/char</div></div><div class="stat"><div class="v am">1,167</div><div class="l">GPT-5.6 Chars</div><div class="s">Between extremes</div></div><div class="stat"><div class="v ac">4,797</div><div class="l">GPT-5-nano Chars</div><div class="s">Small models compensate with words</div></div></div>
<p class="note">Three measurable dimensions: <strong>Detection</strong> (latent, code scanning) → <strong>Implementation</strong> (test pass rate) → <strong>Narration</strong> (reasoning text). Silent Inference exists when the first two are true and the third is false. <strong>7× gap in cost per character.</strong></p>
<div class="wtm"><strong>What This Means:</strong> <span class="role cfo">CFO</span> Claude's $0.0007/char is 7× DeepSeek's $0.0001/char. At 20 sessions/day for a 10-engineer team, the character-cost difference alone adds ~$10,000/year in avoidable spend. <span class="role cto">CTO</span> Do not infer capability from prose volume — DeepSeek's 386 chars produce the same structural code as Claude's 1,639.</div>
<a href="#s2" class="cta-btn ghost">The discovery: both implement, only one pays →</a>
</div></section>

<!-- S2: DISCOVERY -->
<section class="slide s2" id="s2"><div class="inr">
<div class="pulse">02 · The Discovery</div>
<h2>Both implement all seven constraints.<br>Only one charges you to explain how.</h2>
<p class="lead">We gave 8 models the identical task. Scanned every generated <code>.py</code> file. Both Claude and DeepSeek implemented every single requirement. The difference is <strong style="color:var(--rd)">HOW</strong> — not <strong style="color:var(--t)">WHETHER</strong>.</p>
<div class="constraints">
<div class="cr head"><div class="nm">Constraint</div><div class="fl">DeepSeek Code</div><div class="fl">Claude Code</div><div class="ck">DS</div><div class="ck">CL</div></div>
<div class="cr"><div class="nm">JWT auth</div><div class="fl gn">auth.py, extensions.py</div><div class="fl gn">auth.py, extensions.py</div><div class="ck">—</div><div class="ck gn">✓</div></div>
<div class="cr"><div class="nm">Rate limiting</div><div class="fl gn">auth_routes.py</div><div class="fl gn">rate_limit.py</div><div class="ck">—</div><div class="ck gn">✓</div></div>
