<div class="cr"><div class="nm">API versioning</div><div class="fl gn">routes/v1/</div><div class="fl gn">Blueprint /v1/</div><div class="ck">—</div><div class="ck gn">✓</div></div>
</div>
<p class="note">At <strong style="color:var(--rd)">$10/Mtok</strong> (Claude) vs <strong style="color:var(--gn)">$0.022/Mtok</strong> (DeepSeek), narration is catastrophically expensive. <strong style="color:var(--gn)">DeepSeek: 1,873 builds/$.</strong> <strong style="color:var(--rd)">Claude: 4 builds/$.</strong> A 473× gap. The code is the same. The price is what differs.</p>
<a href="#s3" class="cta-btn ghost">How big is the Explanation Tax? →</a>
