<div class="wtm"><strong>What This Means:</strong> <span class="role cfo">CFO</span> The same Task Manager API cost $0.010 on DeepSeek vs $2.022 on Claude — a 202× gap across 3 separate domains. The pattern holds everywhere. <span class="role cto">CTO</span> DeepSeek's failures are framework-mismatch (FastAPI vs Flask), not capability. Pin frameworks and dependencies explicitly in your prompts.</div>
