<!-- S7: THE MODEL + CHART -->
<section class="slide s7" id="s7"><div class="inr wide">
<div class="pulse">07 · The Model</div>
<h2>Price the outcome, not the prompt.</h2>
<div class="eq-block" style="background:var(--bg3);border:1px solid var(--b);border-radius:12px;padding:1.2rem;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:0.7rem;line-height:1.9;color:var(--t2);max-width:700px;margin:1rem auto;text-align:left">
<span style="color:var(--ac)">C₀</span> = baseline session cost · <span style="color:var(--ac)">EPM(t)</span> = Energy Price Multiplier<br>
<span style="color:var(--ac)">β</span> = 0.001 tok/line · <span style="color:var(--ac)">v</span> = velocity · <span style="color:var(--ac)">N</span> = sessions<br>
<span style="color:var(--ac)">P</span> = pass rate · <span style="color:var(--ac)">K</span> = outcomes · <span style="color:var(--ac)">A</span> = arch multiplier · <span style="color:var(--ac)">ϵ</span> = Expl Tax

<br><br><span style="color:var(--gn)">c(t) = C₀ × EPM(t) × (1 + β·v·t)</span>
<span style="color:var(--gn)">C(N,v) = C₀ × EPM(N) × [N + β·v·N(N−1)/2]</span>
<span style="color:var(--gn)">CostPerOutcome(K,v) = C(K/P, v) / K</span>
<span style="color:var(--gn)">C_month = E × C₀ × EPM(N) × [N + β·v·N(N−1)/2]</span>

<br><br><span style="color:var(--am)">Gap = (A × Verbosity × (1+ϵ)) × EPM(N)</span>
</div>
<div class="chart-wrap"><canvas id="costChart"></canvas></div>
<p class="note">Cumulative cost projection: 10-engineer team, 20 sessions/day, 20 days/month. DeepSeek starts at $72/month. Claude at $3,548/month. The gap widens with energy prices and codebase growth.</p>
<div class="stats" style="margin-top:0.5rem"><div class="stat"><div class="v am">1.00×</div><div class="l">EPM 2024</div><div class="s">460 TWh</div></div><div class="stat"><div class="v am">1.20×</div><div class="l">EPM 2030</div><div class="s">945–1,200 TWh</div></div><div class="stat"><div class="v am">1.38×</div><div class="l">EPM 2035</div><div class="s">1,300 TWh</div></div><div class="stat"><div class="v rd">1.80×</div><div class="l">EPM 2050</div><div class="s">2,700 TWh</div></div></div>
<div class="wtm"><strong>What This Means:</strong> <span class="role cfo">CFO</span> At 2030 EPM (1.2×), the monthly DeepSeek-vs-Claude gap widens from $3,476 to $4,172. <span class="role cto">CTO</span> Use CostPerOutcome, not per-session price, for all routing decisions. The 61% pass rate model can beat the 100% pass rate model on true cost per working outcome.</div>
<a href="#s8" class="cta-btn ghost">Calculate your ROI →</a>
</div></section>

<!-- S8: ROI CALCULATOR -->
<section class="slide s8" id="s8"><div class="inr wide">
<div class="pulse">08 · ROI Calculator</div>
<h2>What does this cost <em>your</em> team?</h2>
<div class="roi-calc">
<div class="row"><div><label>Team Size (engineers) <span class="val" id="v_eng">10</span></label><input type="range" min="1" max="100" value="10" oninput="updateROI()" id="r_eng"></div><div><label>Sessions / Engineer / Day <span class="val" id="v_ses">20</span></label><input type="range" min="1" max="100" value="20" oninput="updateROI()" id="r_ses"></div></div>
<div class="row"><div><label>Velocity (lines/session) <span class="val" id="v_vel">500</span></label><input type="range" min="50" max="2000" value="500" oninput="updateROI()" id="r_vel"></div><div><label>Working Days / Month <span class="val" id="v_day">20</span></label><input type="range" min="15" max="25" value="20" oninput="updateROI()" id="r_day"></div></div>
<div class="row"><div><label>Energy Scenario <span class="val" id="v_epm">2024 (1.00×)</span></label><input type="range" min="0" max="4" value="0" oninput="updateROI()" id="r_epm"></div><div><label>Loaded Cost / Engineer / Month <span class="val" id="v_cost">$20,000</span></label><input type="range" min="5000" max="50000" value="20000" oninput="updateROI()" id="r_cost"></div></div>
<div class="roi-out" id="roi_output"></div></div>
